#: https://github.com/Icinga/icingaweb2/blob/eae73ba3d358923fcf741225019f2dbb7c04c643/modules/setup/library/Setup/WebWizard.php#L188
#: https://github.com/Icinga/icingaweb2/blob/eae73ba3d358923fcf741225019f2dbb7c04c643/modules/setup/library/Setup/WebWizard.php#L225
msgid ""
